        <p>Zam-Buk is made by a secret and wonderful scientific process, and composed of rare vegetable juices and saps. it is always ready for use immediately it is wanted. Zam-Buk is recognised as the world's one great and only healing balm for every day household use. Of all chemists, for 1/1?; or 2/9 per box. The 2/9 size is the most economical for family use, as it contains nearly four times as much as the 1/14 size. Keep a box handy, because daily mishaps make Zam-Buk</p>
