nise the industry and the I i affairs of the country in the interests of the people instead of in the interests of the few. Mr. I in EN Kidney trouble preys upon the mind Summerbell declared that it was the intention of the, discourages and lessens ambition, Labour party to introduce an Unemployed Bill, next : AND beauty, vigor and cheerfulness Soon year making it compulsory, if there were a large number , of unemployed, for the municipality to find work for WOMEN disappear when the kidneys are out . . those people. if any men would not do work when it ' ' of order or diseased. For pleasing was offered to them, power would be given to send them results use Dr. Kilmer's Swamp-Root. At chemists for six Menths' hard labour. (Laughter.) It was often • contended that unemployment was due in a great 'e b post free alsopamphlet.Dr. Kilmer ,measure bottle y p , . to intemperance but in Sunderland the &amp; Co., Dept. 329, Temple Chambers, London.</p>
