      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-10-12_WidnesExaminer_art0082" n="art0082">
        <head>Examiner, Saturday, October 12, 1907.</head>
        <p>The Examiner, Saturday, October 12, 1907.</p>
        <p>E. Wrigley (wing threequarter) 20 D. McGregor (five-eighth) 25 H. H. Messenger (five-eighth) W. T. Wynyard (half back) 25 W. H. Mackrell (forward) C. Dunning (forward) W. T. Tyler (forward) T. W. Cross (forward) I C. J. Pearce (forward) 25 I W. Johnson (forward)</p>
